msgid "本页定位当前实现，不复制各目录的完整合同。生产 MCU 入口只有 STM32F4，精确 器件与模式以[支持范围](../delivery/support.md)为准；F407 Board 与新增料号的软件 参考分别说明。其他 SDK 原位保留，目录、实现、执行记录和物理资格不相互替代。"
msgstr "This page locates current implementations without copying each directory contract. STM32F4 is the sole production MCU entry; [support scope](../delivery/support.md) defines exact devices and modes. F407 Boards and software references for added parts remain distinct. Other SDKs stay in place. Directories, implementation, execution records and physical qualification do not replace one another."


