msgid ""
"顶层共享 MCU `drivers/` 已归入 F4，不增加运行时转发。ILI9341、XPT2046、W25 继续通过公共 I/O "
"访问设备，留在组件目录，不随 MCU 支持包迁移。"
msgstr ""
"Shared MCU sources formerly under root `drivers/` now belong to F4, without "
"extra runtime forwarding. ILI9341, XPT2046 and W25 continue to use public "
"I/O and remain in components rather than moving with the MCU support "
"package."

msgid "Board 和 SoC 不加载本地 Python 插件。声明式包由通用 DataProvider 读取同一快照的 事实和显式 binding 文件，DomainPolicies 决定已维护公共语义与私有投影，有限静态 节点生成配置、存储、face、IRQ 与固定生命周期连接。CMake 仍拥有唯一 C 源码图， SDK 只按选择的包导出归属收集源码。结构图见 [FIG-03 构建期输入与产物](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)， 详细字段与迁移边界由[接入指南](../guides/provider-porting.md)唯一维护。"
msgstr "Board and SoC load no local Python plugins. Generic DataProvider reads one snapshot of declarative package facts and explicit binding files. DomainPolicies determines maintained public semantics and private projections; bounded static nodes emit configuration, storage, faces, IRQ and fixed lifecycle connections. CMake still owns the sole C source graph. The SDK collects source only by selected package export ownership. See [FIG-03 build-time inputs and artifacts](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg); the [porting guide](../guides/provider-porting.md) uniquely owns detailed fields and migration boundaries."

msgid "生产默认路径已采用通用 DataProvider，旧 F4 家族 Python 构造模块和导入注册表已 删除。包事实、策略、各模式和消费者仍须本批集成验证；不能从删除旧代码推定整体 资格。主机 Python 不进入固件，硬件算法和执行顺序由 C 维护。"
msgstr "The production default now uses generic DataProvider; old F4 family Python constructor modules and their import registry have been removed. Package facts, policies, individual modes and consumers still require this batch's integrated validation. Removing old code does not establish overall qualification. Host Python is not linked into firmware; C owns hardware algorithms and execution ordering."

msgid "Core `private/platform_lifecycle_impl.h` 维护整平台启动、停止、回滚与诊断，F4 `private/stm32f4_platform_lifecycle_impl.h` 维护 System 与共享资源的 C 协调；各自的 `.c` 公共入口复用同一实现，固定装配让编译器看到常量并裁剪分支。主机只维护 一套配置实现，其代码不进入 MCU 镜像。实际生成 factory、模型与 ARM 产物 各自验证，不能把源码移动视为整条链路已经验收。 Native 必须显式启用测试 scope，不进入生产系列目录或能力聚合表。"
msgstr "Core `private/platform_lifecycle_impl.h` owns whole-platform start, stop, rollback and diagnostics. F4 `private/stm32f4_platform_lifecycle_impl.h` owns C coordination of System and shared resources. Their public `.c` entries reuse the same implementation; fixed assembly exposes constants for compiler branch elimination. One host configuration implementation is maintained and is not linked into the MCU image. Generated factories, models and ARM artifacts are verified separately; source movement does not qualify the entire chain. Native requires explicit test scope and stays outside production family directories and capability aggregation."

msgid ""
"精确支持见[支持参考](../reference/platforms/support.md)。重构前的目录与执行范围可从 "
"[固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18) "
"追溯；旧记录保留原始身份，不建立本次重构的软件候选或实板资格。"
msgstr ""
"See the [support reference](../reference/platforms/support.md) for exact "
"support. Pre-refactor directories and execution scopes remain traceable at "
"the [fixed prior source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18). Old records retain"
" their original identities and do not establish software candidates or "
"physical-board qualification for this refactor."
